WEBVTT

00:06:28.676 --> 00:06:32.346
and then in the afternoon, as they waited
for their afternoon shift.

00:06:32.763 --> 00:06:33.931
And today,

00:06:33.931 --> 00:06:37.101
the game has evolved into what
my team and I at My Home Stars,

00:06:37.101 --> 00:06:39.061
a nonprofit we are running in Uganda,

00:06:39.061 --> 00:06:42.481
have called the 5 STA-Z
educational board game.

00:06:42.523 --> 00:06:45.359
And here is how the 5 STA-Z
education board works.

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:47.069
At the beginning,

00:06:47.111 --> 00:06:50.573
a classroom divides itself
into groups of five children.

00:06:51.073 --> 00:06:54.577
And these children
begin interacting with one another

00:06:54.618 --> 00:06:56.662
on questions and content we've developed

00:06:56.704 --> 00:06:59.498
in partnership
with a group of 16 teachers.

00:06:59.957 --> 00:07:02.835
All this content is a reflection
of the actual content